      "number": "8.47",
      "text": "(a) In switching a p junction from forward to reverse bias, assume that the ratio of reverse current, I_r, to forward current, I_f, is 0.2. Determine the ratio of storage time to minority carrier lifetime, τ_s/τ_p. (b) Repeat part (a) if the ratio of I_f to I_r is 1.5."
    },
    {
      "number": "8.48",
